@* ============================================================
   AUTHOR: PlantSafety Platform
   CREATED: 2026-07-14
   FILE DESCRIPTION: Project-root global Razor imports. Razor's _Imports.razor
     cascades only to files in the same directory and its subdirectories —
     Components/_Imports.razor therefore never reached Modules/** (a sibling
     directory tree), which was the root cause of widespread "type or
     namespace not found" errors for NavigationState/AlertsState/TenantState/
     etc. across every Modules/<ModuleName>/Pages page. This root-level file
     mirrors Components/_Imports.razor and applies to the whole project
     (Components/**, Modules/**, and any future top-level Razor folders).
   SchemaVersion: 2026.1
   Additive-only evolution — see Enterprise Architectural Rule Handbook §XI
   ============================================================ *@

